# DECLARED layer — see the extraction guide §3a. A `proxmox_lxc` resource is NOT
# the LXCContainer it provisions; they are related by aegis:provisions and must
# never be merged, or drift becomes unrepresentable.

aegis:TerraformResourceShape a sh:NodeShape ;
    sh:targetClass aegis:TerraformResource ;
    sh:property [
        sh:path aegis:resourceType ;
        sh:datatype xsd:string ;
        sh:maxCount 1 ;
